## Output Format
Respond ONLY with a JSON object:
{
  "category": "answer_from_report" | "gap_detected" | "refine_report" | "new_topic",
  "response": "Your response text to show the user (for answer_from_report and gap_detected categories)",
  "edit_instruction": "The specific edit to apply (for refine_report only, otherwise null)"
}
